<sami>
 <head>
  <style type="text/css">
   <!--
    .en-US {
     lang: en-US;
    }

    .fr-FR {
     lang: fr-FR;
    }
   -->
  </style>
 </head>
 <body>
  <sync start="500">
   <p class="en-US">
    Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Le matin sur la digue de Saltmere.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="3000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="3200">
   <p class="en-US">
    The ferry leaves at seven,<br/>
    as it has for forty years.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Le ferry part à sept heures,<br/>
    comme depuis quarante ans.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="5800">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="6000">
   <p class="en-US">
    [gulls calling]
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    [cris de mouettes]
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="8000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="8200">
   <p class="en-US">
    Tide's turning. We should check<br/>
    the mooring buoys.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    La marée tourne. Vérifions<br/>
    les bouées d'amarrage.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="11000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="11200">
   <p class="en-US">
    The lighthouse keeper logs<br/>
    every boat that passes.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Le gardien du phare note<br/>
    chaque bateau qui passe.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="14000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="14200">
   <p class="en-US">
    ♪ brass band playing ♪
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    ♪ fanfare au loin ♪
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="16500">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="16800">
   <p class="en-US">
    Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Capitainerie, ici la vedette du pilote.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="19500">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="19700">
   <p class="en-US">
    Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Le brouillard arrive du môle vers midi.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="22000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="22200">
   <p class="en-US">
    Keep to the marked channel<br/>
    past the red buoy.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Restez dans le chenal balisé<br/>
    après la bouée rouge.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="25000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="25200">
   <p class="en-US">
    By evening the quay is quiet again.
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    Le soir, le quai redevient calme.
   </p>
  </sync>
  <sync start="28000">
   <p class="en-US">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
   <p class="fr-FR">
    &nbsp;
   </p>
  </sync>
 </body>
</sami>
